Type a command line, then exercise the cursor/scroll navigation keys (home, end,
line-start ^A, line-end ^E, page up/down, scroll up/down) in the typing handler.

-- input --
type hello world navigation test
key home
key ctrl-e
key ctrl-a
key end
key pgup
key pgdown
key up
key down
